<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS2.SSS6" title="In A.2 More details on possible choices of Markov transition matrices ‣ Appendix A Additional details regarding D3PMs ‣ Structured Denoising Diffusion Models in Discrete State-Spaces" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.2.6 </span>Combinations of absorbing diffusion and other diffusion</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
