<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span>Additional uncurated generation examples from various models</h3>

<figure id="A2.F10" class="ltx_figure">
<p id="A2.F10.3" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A2.F10.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="--ltx-border-color:#000000;padding:3.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F10.3.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
